{"id":"5dd51ee837134717","group":"16","path":"16/16-ex-church-weak-nno.md","title":"Church 数字的弱递归性质","display":"ex-church-weak-nno — Church 数字的弱递归性质","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-ex-church-weak-nno","aliases":["16-ex-church-weak-nno"],"display":"ex-church-weak-nno — Church 数字的弱递归性质","depends_on":["[[16-df-hagino-functor]]"],"source":"Section 8.2 p.456 (PDF 476), p.460 (PDF 480)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-ex-church-weak-nno"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-ex-church-weak-nno</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-church-weak-nno — Church 数字的弱递归性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a61be48bb6776bfc\" href=\"?note=a61be48bb6776bfc\" title=\"16-df-hagino-functor\">16-df-hagino-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Section 8.2 p.456 (PDF 476), p.460 (PDF 480)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a61be48bb6776bfc\" href=\"?note=a61be48bb6776bfc\" title=\"16-df-hagino-functor\">16-df-hagino-functor</a> 定义的类型变量语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi\">\\(\\Xi\\)</span> 及闭项商范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_\\Xi\">\\(\\mathcal C_\\Xi\\)</span>，使用其中的 λ2 子语法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为任意类型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:1\\to A\">\\(a:1\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to A\">\\(f:A\\to A\\)</span> 为闭项转换类，选定闭项代表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=[\\widehat a]\">\\(a=[\\widehat a]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=[\\widehat f]\">\\(f=[\\widehat f]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star:1\">\\(\\star:1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_\\lambda\">\\(\\mathbb N_\\lambda\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_{a,f}\">\\(h_{a,f}\\)</span> 在本页定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 遍历外部自然数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^0\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}_A\">\\(f^0\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}_A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{n+1}\\coloneqq f\\circ f^n\">\\(f^{n+1}\\coloneqq f\\circ f^n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbb N_\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall X.(X\\to X)\\to X\\to X,\\\\\nz&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda v:1.\\Lambda X.\\lambda f:X\\to X.\\lambda x:X.x]:1\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda,\\\\\ns&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda n:\\mathbb N_\\lambda.\\Lambda X.\\lambda f:X\\to X.\\lambda x:X.f(n[X]f x)]:\\mathbb N_\\lambda\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda,\\\\\nh_{a,f}&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda n:\\mathbb N_\\lambda.n[A]\\widehat f(\\widehat a\\star)]:\\mathbb N_\\lambda\\to A,\\\\\nh_{a,f}\\circ z&amp;=a,\\qquad h_{a,f}\\circ s=f\\circ h_{a,f},\\\\\nc_n&amp;\\coloneqq s^n\\circ z:1\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda,\\qquad\nh_{a,f}\\circ c_n=f^n\\circ a.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbb N_\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall X.(X\\to X)\\to X\\to X,\\\\\nz&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda v:1.\\Lambda X.\\lambda f:X\\to X.\\lambda x:X.x]:1\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda,\\\\\ns&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda n:\\mathbb N_\\lambda.\\Lambda X.\\lambda f:X\\to X.\\lambda x:X.f(n[X]f x)]:\\mathbb N_\\lambda\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda,\\\\\nh_{a,f}&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda n:\\mathbb N_\\lambda.n[A]\\widehat f(\\widehat a\\star)]:\\mathbb N_\\lambda\\to A,\\\\\nh_{a,f}\\circ z&amp;=a,\\qquad h_{a,f}\\circ s=f\\circ h_{a,f},\\\\\nc_n&amp;\\coloneqq s^n\\circ z:1\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda,\\qquad\nh_{a,f}\\circ c_n=f^n\\circ a.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§8.2 p.456（PDF476）及 p.460（PDF480）。零箭头显式抽象一个单位类型变量，故是闭项范畴中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda\">\\(1\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda\\)</span> 箭头。介体的商类由同余独立于代表元选择。前两条方程由 β 计算和单位 η 给出；最后一式对外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 归纳。它只给每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,f\">\\(a,f\\)</span> 一个递归介体，并没有证明所有介体相等，因而不能当作 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" href=\"?note=ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" title=\"16-df-nno\">16-df-nno</a> 的唯一性版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-hagino-functor","status":"resolved","id":"a61be48bb6776bfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-hagino-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-hagino-functor","status":"resolved","id":"a61be48bb6776bfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-hagino-functor]] 定义的类型变量语境 $\\Xi$ 及闭项商范畴 $\\mathcal C_\\Xi$，使用其中的 λ2 子语法。$A$ 为任意类型，$a:1\\to A$、$f:A\\to A$ 为闭项转换类，选定闭项代表 $a=[\\widehat a]$、$f=[\\widehat f]$，$\\star:1$。$\\mathbb N_\\lambda$、$z$、$s$、$h_{a,f}$ 在本页定义；$n$ 遍历外部自然数，$f^0\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}_A$，$f^{n+1}\\coloneqq f\\circ f^n$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-nno","status":"resolved","id":"ddbc8ac3dacc270e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：§8.2 p.456（PDF476）及 p.460（PDF480）。零箭头显式抽象一个单位类型变量，故是闭项范畴中的 $1\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda$ 箭头。介体的商类由同余独立于代表元选择。前两条方程由 β 计算和单位 η 给出；最后一式对外部 $n$ 归纳。它只给每个 $a,f$ 一个递归介体，并没有证明所有介体相等，因而不能当作 [[16-df-nno]] 的唯一性版本。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Xi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_\\Xi","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"a:1\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"a=[\\widehat a]","display":false},{"tex":"f=[\\widehat f]","display":false},{"tex":"\\star:1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"h_{a,f}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"f^0\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}_A","display":false},{"tex":"f^{n+1}\\coloneqq f\\circ f^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbb N_\\lambda&\\coloneqq\\forall X.(X\\to X)\\to X\\to X,\\\\\nz&\\coloneqq[\\lambda v:1.\\Lambda X.\\lambda f:X\\to X.\\lambda x:X.x]:1\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda,\\\\\ns&\\coloneqq[\\lambda n:\\mathbb N_\\lambda.\\Lambda X.\\lambda f:X\\to X.\\lambda x:X.f(n[X]f x)]:\\mathbb N_\\lambda\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda,\\\\\nh_{a,f}&\\coloneqq[\\lambda n:\\mathbb N_\\lambda.n[A]\\widehat f(\\widehat a\\star)]:\\mathbb N_\\lambda\\to A,\\\\\nh_{a,f}\\circ z&=a,\\qquad h_{a,f}\\circ s=f\\circ h_{a,f},\\\\\nc_n&\\coloneqq s^n\\circ z:1\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda,\\qquad\nh_{a,f}\\circ c_n=f^n\\circ a.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"1\\to\\mathbb N_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"a,f","display":false}],"bytes":1874,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]、[[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]、[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]、[[16-thm-categorical-completeness]]、[[16-df-lambda-systems]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-signature]]、[[16-df-hagino-functor]]、[[16-thm-weak-initial-algebra]]、[[16-ex-church-weak-nno]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]、[[16-df-lambda-fibrations]]。"}],"outgoing":["a61be48bb6776bfc","ddbc8ac3dacc270e"]}